Hi,

yes, the function 'predict' does what you want:

data(H3N2)
pop(H3N2) <- factor(H3N2$other$epid)
dapc1 <- dapc(H3N2, var.contrib=FALSE, scale=FALSE, n.pca=150, n.da=5)
predict(dapc1)


Cheers
Thibaut

